- 4dd0f00-4e070ce session_log: the legacy seq is a caller-supplied per-session counter; the new seq is engine-assigned (N16), in legacy insertion order (ts, rowid)
- 4dd0f00-4e070ce observed_actions: as session_log; segments_json did not exist
- 4dd0f00-4e070ce regret: the regret proxy is not built in any build (hook/handler.ts "SKELETON: G32"); fact_ref may embed ids
- 4dd0f00-4e070ce whisper_audit: no seq or subject_key column in this layout: seq assigned in legacy order (ts, rowid); subject_key NULL
- 4dd0f00-4e070ce faults: the fault history status reads (FR-M2); ids are ULIDs
- 4dd0f00-4e070ce whisper_stats: 59cc05c's windowed replica; the fold republishes it from the carried corrections and whisper_audit from watermark 0
